  "normal_border_topology": "CellBorder normal Init, ShowParts, all eight directions, DoesCellExistAndNormal, HideParts, ActivateBorders and normal OnRecycle follow actual ARM64 access/query order. Every neighbor property is read afresh. Sides contains all eight directions from native metadata; four-side/corner arrays and field SHA256 identities are separately checked. ShifterGridId uses +0xd8 and is distinct from BoardId at +0x68. Predicate supports separated grids; shifter orchestration itself is pending.",
  "normal_cell_lifecycle": "CellView ordinary InitializeView assigns delegate, reparents with worldPositionStays, preserves current local Z, reads Point twice for XY, sets scale, loads CellAssets, sets front then background color, enables filling mask and initializes border. Show toggles front/background before normal border topology. Mask interaction uses VisibleOutsideMask=2, updates front/background/all border/all fill before flag. Normal recycle resets countdown/border/interaction. CellModel CreateView calls Initialize and Show before assigning CellView. World/local queries read actual Transform, including Z.",
  "production_composition": "Foundation prefab owns a static CellParent under BoardRoot and path-loads CellPrefab. CellAssets.CreateItemPools requests 100 cell views (pool0). Formal fixed 9x8 grid now spawns 72 cell views with 28 available and 38 visible rectangle border parts, with original background/front colors. All cells bind the actual view and shared freeze countdown. Countdown update belongs to CellView.Update; current-frame quantized delta follows DeltaTimeManager.get_DeltaTime, never a previous LateUpdate cache. Full native staged pool registration remains pending.",
