  },
  "stencil_source": "Original exported shader placeholders and Sprites/Default bindings were insufficient. Actual data.unity3d shader path IDs21/25 retain Blend Zero One for RGB/alpha, ZWrite Off, LEqual, Cull Back, RGBA mask15, Always compare with writer IncrSat and reader DecrSat. Original GLES2/GLES3 vertex multiplies VP*object*float4(position.xyz,1); fragment returns zero, with no texture/clip. Matching native material shader GUIDs now resolve to restored shaders. Source state/program hashes are in cell_stencil_source_verification.json. Four real GPU counter/saturation cases and color-buffer preservation pass in Unity DX11; the observed white mask bar is eliminated.",
